---
layout: base.njk
title: Paketler | MERTDTRAİNİNG
description: "Transformation, Athletic Performance ve özel mikro program paketleri — MERTDTRAİNİNG."
active: egitimler.html
permalink: /egitimler/
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Program Paketleri</span>
    <h1>Paketler</h1>
    <p>Tüm programlar online sunulur. Transformation, atletik performans ve hedefe özel mikro paketler.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="filters" id="filters" role="group" aria-label="Paket filtreleri">
      <button type="button" class="chip active" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Tümü</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="transform" aria-pressed="false">Transformation</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="athletic" aria-pressed="false">Athletic Performance</button>
      <button type="button" class="chip" data-filter="mikro" aria-pressed="false">Özel Mikro</button>
    </div>
    <div class="products" id="products">
      {% for p in products %}
      {% set waText = "Merhaba, " + p.title + " paketi hakkında detaylı bilgi almak istiyorum." %}
      <article
        class="product"
        data-category="{{ p.category }}"
        data-id="{{ p.id }}"
        style="border-color:{{ p.accent }}44"
      >
        <div class="product-cover" style="background:linear-gradient(145deg,{{ p.color[0] }},{{ p.color[1] }})">
          {% if p.tag %}<span class="tag">{{ p.tag }}</span>{% endif %}
          <span class="level">{{ p.level }}</span>
          {{ p.title }}
        </div>
        <div class="product-body">
          <h3>{{ p.title }}</h3>
          <p>{{ p.desc }}</p>
          <ul class="product-features">
            {% for f in p.features %}
            <li>{{ f }}</li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          <div class="product-foot">
            {% if site.whatsapp %}
            <a
              class="btn btn-primary btn-block product-wa"
              href="https://wa.me/{{ site.whatsapp }}?text={{ waText | urlencode }}"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
            >Detaylı bilgi için WhatsApp’tan yazınız</a>
            {% else %}
            <a class="btn btn-primary btn-block product-wa" href="/iletisim/">Detaylı bilgi için WhatsApp’tan yazınız</a>
            {% endif %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="packages-note">Tüm programlar online olarak sunulur. Eğitim materyalleri pakete dahildir. Fiyat ve başlangıç için WhatsApp’tan yazman yeterli.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ItemList",
  "name": "MERTDTRAİNİNG Program Paketleri",
  "itemListElement": [
    {% for p in products %}
    {
      "@type": "ListItem",
      "position": {{ loop.index }},
      "item": {
        "@type": "Service",
        "name": {{ p.title | json | safe }},
        "description": {{ p.desc | json | safe }},
        "provider": {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": {{ site.name | json | safe }}
        },
        "url": "{{ site.url }}/egitimler/"
      }
    }{% if not loop.last %},{% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  ]
}
</script>
